---@class aws.mediatailor.CreatePrefetchScheduleRequest
---@field Consumption? aws.mediatailor.PrefetchConsumption The configuration settings for how and when MediaTailor consumes prefetched ads from the ad decision server for single prefetch schedules. Each consumption configuration contains an end time and an optional start time that define the consumption window. Prefetch schedules automatically expire no earlier than seven days after the end time.
---@field Name aws.mediatailor.__string The name to assign to the schedule request.
---@field PlaybackConfigurationName aws.mediatailor.__string The name to assign to the playback configuration.
---@field Retrieval? aws.mediatailor.PrefetchRetrieval The configuration settings for retrieval of prefetched ads from the ad decision server. Only one set of prefetched ads will be retrieved and subsequently consumed for each ad break.
---@field RecurringPrefetchConfiguration? aws.mediatailor.RecurringPrefetchConfiguration The configuration that defines how and when MediaTailor performs ad prefetching in a live event.
---@field ScheduleType? aws.mediatailor.PrefetchScheduleType|string The frequency that MediaTailor creates prefetch schedules. SINGLE indicates that this schedule applies to one ad break. RECURRING indicates that MediaTailor automatically creates a schedule for each ad avail in a live event.
---@field StreamId? aws.mediatailor.__string An optional stream identifier that MediaTailor uses to prefetch ads for multiple streams that use the same playback configuration. If StreamId is specified, MediaTailor returns all of the prefetch schedules with an exact match on StreamId. If not specified, MediaTailor returns all of the prefetch schedules for the playback configuration, regardless of StreamId.
---@field Tags? aws.mediatailor.__mapOf__string The tags to assign to the prefetch schedule. Tags are key-value pairs that you can associate with Amazon resources to help with organization, access control, and cost tracking. For more information, see Tagging AWS Elemental MediaTailor Resources.

