---@alias aws.mediatailor.LogTypes (aws.mediatailor.LogType|string)[]

---@alias aws.mediatailor.LoggingStrategy "VENDED_LOGS"|"LEGACY_CLOUDWATCH"

---The configuration for manifest processing rules. Manifest processing rules enable customization of the personalized manifests created by MediaTailor.
---@class aws.mediatailor.ManifestProcessingRules
---@field AdMarkerPassthrough? aws.mediatailor.AdMarkerPassthrough For HLS, when set to true, MediaTailor passes through EXT-X-CUE-IN, EXT-X-CUE-OUT, and EXT-X-SPLICEPOINT-SCTE35 ad markers from the origin manifest to the MediaTailor personalized manifest.

